# Bcentx Cursor Rules

You are building Bcentx 2.0, a global wealth intelligence platform.

## Stack

- Next.js (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
- Supabase PostgreSQL + Auth (after Sprint 1)
- Vercel hosting

## Preserve

- Blue/green V1 theme (`#1b145e`, `#28a745`, `#e9f5ff`)
- Learning Centre spirit
- Card-based UI
- Beginner-friendly educational tone
- Logo / brand assets under `public/brand/`

## MVP Scope

- Keep MVP scope only
- Do not add advanced AI, payments, subscriptions, community, mobile app, portfolio tracker, wallets, or investment execution unless explicitly requested
- Prioritize risk warnings, country availability, affiliate transparency, and source-backed content

## Trust & Security

- No get-rich-quick or guaranteed-income claims
- No personalized financial, legal, or tax advice
- Do not expose Supabase service role keys
- Public users should only see published content (when DB exists)
- Admin functionality must be protected server-side

## Repository Hygiene

- Do not overwrite `legacy/v1-static-site/` carelessly
- Do not dump the full Google Drive package into the repo
- Update `docs/build-log/BUILD_LOG.md` when completing meaningful tasks
- Record major choices in `docs/build-log/DECISIONS.md`
